cally wrests them out of one shape into another, later commenting that their appetites made them what they truly are. This scene bears the promise of what the magic of modern film can do for ancient myth. It is physically affective, making vivid what could only be imagined before. And it also allows for the adaptation of the story: This Circe has been abused by travelers before. The animals who lurk on her island are the men who have met their comeuppance.ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;9NgabL6fAKKFXOQPKTVytf61I6xzAPoJMnMc54-CeUsƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkx9ni:///sha-256;caWmRzvI5BRopN0xNvxnKB0cavF6U50f48uGx_Zbaqoƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;Qpy5e6TcePHKEiveYq25_cHMOQwdXtqRwNtDTIjJnMsƒdpairƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmark`ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;4c1REciD25jYsYgiDP6NIMbMh137vgfjzlf8KKcupAgƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmarkefalseƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;uyiMLmZRIjSQmqgoaBOEA5HCxckcgt6PKbg19216c20ƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmarkdtrueƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;_553Xrb5Q6rv_Q-QOkQmq2TC2o-bqDNnOG07Vb40ZE4ƒdpairƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmark`ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;BI3z5i47g5ALizUg1LpeO1g64hH6V4VMJDOlBtdakk8ƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkdTextƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;h3PZ595nrD5tuY-LbBXp-_7JcPYQQ25draGmKlFSjQoƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkqSyndicationSourceƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;EuLtaP9Q4E6N-lEdlpPFd6TJX3w-KAq8x2u7ibpAkioƒdpairƒerightdunitƒe